<title>MONGOLIA: Mongolia Jan-Oct gold output up 36.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Mongolia Jan-Oct gold output up 36.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mongolia's gold production in January-October increased by 36.4 percent compared with the same period a year ago, official figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Mongolia produced 4.33 tonnes of gold in January-October, up from 3.17 tonnes in the year-ago period, the State Statistics Bulletin said. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
